<h2>9.1 stream</h2>
<ul>
<li>使用Stream完成java文件IO基本操作
<ul>
<li>File类:文件绑定</li>
<li>FileInputStream/FileOutputStream类:单字符输出</li>
<li>BufferedInputStream/BufferedOutputStream类:缓冲区字符输出</li>
<li>BufferedReader/PrintReader类:字符串输出</li>
<li>ObjectOutputStream/ObjectInputStream类:对象序列化</li>
</ul>
</li>
